Run python tools/test_host.py from the project root.

test_gear_control: routing, phases, speed-feedback decisions and protections.
test_web_contract: command validation and handoff to the physics task.
test_network: non-blocking Wi-Fi state machine using controllable stubs.
stubs/ and network_stubs/: host replacements, never firmware drivers.

Browser tests: python tools/test_browser.py.
Hardware capture timing, analog calibration and hydraulics need bench testing.
